{"id":"72859a2d81ce2e93","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy.md","title":"Relativized Arithmetic Hierarchy $\\Sigma n^{0,A}$","display":"df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy — Relativized Arithmetic Hierarchy $\\Sigma_n^{0,A}$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy","aliases":["58-df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy","58-df-Sigma-0-A"],"display":"df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy — Relativized Arithmetic Hierarchy $\\Sigma_n^{0,A}$","depends_on":["[[58-df-oracle]]","[[58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy</span><span>58-df-Sigma-0-A</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy — Relativized Arithmetic Hierarchy <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{0,A}\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{0,A}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0724d9f2bd401655\" href=\"?note=0724d9f2bd401655\" title=\"58-df-oracle\">58-df-oracle</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8d93d31f2068246\" href=\"?note=e8d93d31f2068246\" title=\"58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula\">58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"58-df-formula\">58-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Oracle}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Oracle}(A)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0724d9f2bd401655\" href=\"?note=0724d9f2bd401655\" title=\"58-df-oracle\">58-df-oracle</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,S,P,D\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,S,P,D\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,k\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (oracle-language formula codes and bounded fragment, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8d93d31f2068246\" href=\"?note=e8d93d31f2068246\" title=\"58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula\">58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (variable-code set and function-graph predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S,\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S,\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S\\)</span> (finite quantifier-block predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelativizedArithmeticHierarchy}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RelativizedArithmeticHierarchy}_S\\)</span> (simultaneous hierarchy predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}exists\\text{-}block}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(v,k,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,k+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{52mm}\\land h(0)=\\psi\\land h(k)=\\varphi\n\\land\\forall i\\in k\\;\\bigl(h(i+1)=\\exists v(i)\\,h(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}exists\\text{-}block}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(v,k,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,k+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{52mm}\\land h(0)=\\psi\\land h(k)=\\varphi\n\\land\\forall i\\in k\\;\\bigl(h(i+1)=\\exists v(i)\\,h(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}forall\\text{-}block}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(v,k,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,k+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{52mm}\\land h(0)=\\psi\\land h(k)=\\varphi\n\\land\\forall i\\in k\\;\\bigl(h(i+1)=\\forall v(i)\\,h(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}forall\\text{-}block}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(v,k,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,k+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{52mm}\\land h(0)=\\psi\\land h(k)=\\varphi\n\\land\\forall i\\in k\\;\\bigl(h(i+1)=\\forall v(i)\\,h(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelativizedArithmeticHierarchy}_S(S,P,D;A,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Oracle}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(S,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(P,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(D,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land S(0)=\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)\n\\land P(0)=\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\nS(n+1)=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma):\\exists\\psi\\in P(n)\\;\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land P(n+1)=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma):\\exists\\psi\\in S(n)\\;\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land D(n)=S(n)\\cap P(n)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelativizedArithmeticHierarchy}_S(S,P,D;A,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Oracle}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(S,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(P,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(D,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land S(0)=\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)\n\\land P(0)=\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\nS(n+1)=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma):\\exists\\psi\\in P(n)\\;\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land P(n+1)=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma):\\exists\\psi\\in S(n)\\;\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{47mm}\\land D(n)=S(n)\\cap P(n)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The three levels are encoded by set functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,P,D\">\\(S,P,D\\)</span> on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>, so the successor clauses form one simultaneous recursion rather than a family of free indexed class symbols.</li>\n<li>The finite variable list and every intermediate quantified formula are explicit function graphs.  The case <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=0\">\\(k=0\\)</span> is the empty quantifier block and yields <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi=\\psi\">\\(\\varphi=\\psi\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Conventional notation is recovered from any hierarchy witness by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=S(n)\">\\(\\Sigma_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=S(n)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=P(n)\">\\(\\Pi_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=P(n)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=D(n)\">\\(\\Delta_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=D(n)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>&quot;<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1d779f4a08a1f22e\" href=\"?note=1d779f4a08a1f22e\" title=\"58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy\">58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy</a> — 绝对算术层级&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0724d9f2bd401655\" href=\"?note=0724d9f2bd401655\" title=\"58-df-oracle\">58-df-oracle</a> — Oracle&quot;</li>\n<li>&quot;<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"da8df6fd73c2eb5e\" href=\"?note=da8df6fd73c2eb5e\" title=\"58-df-relativized-recursive\">58-df-relativized-recursive</a> — 相对化递归&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"0724d9f2bd401655","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-oracle]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e8d93d31f2068246","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"0724d9f2bd401655","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\omega$ and $\\mathrm{Oracle}(A)$ (see [[58-df-oracle]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e8d93d31f2068246","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)$ and $\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)$ (oracle-language formula codes and bounded fragment, see [[58-df-delta-0-oracle-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"1d779f4a08a1f22e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"\"[[58-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]] — 绝对算术层级\"","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-oracle","status":"resolved","id":"0724d9f2bd401655","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"\"[[58-df-oracle]] — Oracle\"","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-relativized-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"da8df6fd73c2eb5e","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Related Concepts]","excerpt":"\"[[58-df-relativized-recursive]] — 相对化递归\"","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^{0,A}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Oracle}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma,S,P,D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"n,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S,\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelativizedArithmeticHierarchy}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}exists\\text{-}block}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(v,k,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,k+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\\\\n&\\hspace{52mm}\\land h(0)=\\psi\\land h(k)=\\varphi\n\\land\\forall i\\in k\\;\\bigl(h(i+1)=\\exists v(i)\\,h(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}forall\\text{-}block}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\exists v,h\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Function}(v,k,\\mathrm{Var}_S)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,k+1,\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\\\\n&\\hspace{52mm}\\land h(0)=\\psi\\land h(k)=\\varphi\n\\land\\forall i\\in k\\;\\bigl(h(i+1)=\\forall v(i)\\,h(i)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relativized\\text{-}arithmetic\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelativizedArithmeticHierarchy}_S(S,P,D;A,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Oracle}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(S,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(P,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}\\bigl(D,\\omega,\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land S(0)=\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)\n\\land P(0)=\\Delta_0^{0,A}(\\Sigma)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\nS(n+1)=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma):\\exists\\psi\\in P(n)\\;\\mathrm{ExistsBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{47mm}\\land P(n+1)=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^A(\\Sigma):\\exists\\psi\\in S(n)\\;\\mathrm{ForallBlock}^{A,\\Sigma}_S(\\varphi,\\psi)\\}\\\\\n&\\hspace{47mm}\\land D(n)=S(n)\\cap P(n)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"S,P,D","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"k=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi=\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=S(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=P(n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_n^{0,A}(\\Sigma)=D(n)","display":false}],"bytes":3677,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1070","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-relativized-arithmetic-hierarchy.md|58-df-relativized-arithmetic-hierar